lisa-design:
- setup-opentofu v2.0.2 is pinned by commit SHA (a1320f8…) and resolves versions from get.opentofu.org, not the GitHub API, so the job passes it no token; tofu_version 1.13.9 matches the local OpenTofu.
- required's result check is generic over toJSON(needs) (failure/cancelled fail, skipped passes), so adding tofu to needs is all it takes; no per-job line was added.
